  "title": "GFW DIST-ALERT — global vegetation disturbance alerts (Landsat + Sentinel-2)",
  "url": "https://www.globalforestwatch.org/blog/data-and-tools/global-vegetation-disturbance-alerts/",
  "snippet": "Global Forest Watch announces DIST-ALERT, a new data product providing global vegetation disturbance alerts using combined Landsat 8/9 and Sentinel-2A/B imagery. The system detects deforestation, degradation, and other vegetation loss events with improved temporal frequency and spatial resolution compared to previous GLAD alerts. Available through the GFW platform for near-real-time forest monitoring worldwide.",
